"color":"rgb(248, 241, 238)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"H3","cls":"","text":"I was doing everything\nright. And I still felt\ncompletely lost.","x":16,"y":6285.34375,"w":343,"h":161.25,"font":"700 36px / 40.32px \"IBM Plex Sans\", Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"700","letterSpacing":"-1.26px","margin":"48px 0px 25px","padding":"0px","color":"rgb(248, 241, 238)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"P","cls":"","text":"That's the moment I understand better than any theory. It's not about not trying hard enough. It's about running a system that was never designed for this much ","x":16,"y":6471.59375,"w":343,"h":67.1875,"font":"14px / 16.8px Lato, Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","margin":"0px 0px 12px","padding":"0px","color":"rgb(248, 241, 238)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"H2","cls":"","text":"The method based on the NeuroIntegration method by Katerina Lengold","x":19,"y":7114.78125,"w":343,"h":150,"font":"700 31px / 50px \"IBM Plex Sans\", Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"700","letterSpacing":"-1.395px","margin":"0px 0px 61px 3px","padding":"0px","color":"rgb(38, 38, 38)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"P","cls":"","text":"The NeuroIntegration method was developed by Katerina Lengold, founder of the California Institute of Neurointegration.","x":16,"y":7325.78125,"w":343,"h":63,"font":"15px / 21px Lato, Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","margin":"0px 0px 15px","padding":"0px","color":"rgb(92, 84, 103)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"P","cls":"","text":"It combines neuroscience, psychology, and behavioural science into a practical coaching framework that works with how your brain is actually wired. NeuroSprints","x":16,"y":7403.78125,"w":343,"h":126,"font":"15px / 21px Lato, Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","margin":"0px 0px 15px","padding":"0px","color":"rgb(92, 84, 103)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"LI","cls":"","text":"ACT · NEUROSPRINT\nUse neuroscience-informed planning cycles to reach goals without burnout.","x":44,"y":7931.5,"w":315,"h":58,"font":"14px / 21.7px Lato, Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","margin":"0px","padding":"0px 0px 0px 12px","color":"rgb(92, 84, 103)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"LI","cls":"","text":"THINK · NEUROSURFING\nRewire habitual thought patterns, reduce cognitive rigidity, and build creative thinking.","x":44,"y":8019.5,"w":315,"h":58,"font":"14px / 21.7px Lato, Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","margin":"0px","padding":"0px 0px 0px 12px","color":"rgb(92, 84, 103)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"LI","cls":"","text":"FEEL · NEUROBALANCE\nTrain your nervous system to recover faster from stress and stay emotionally balanced.","x":44,"y":8107.5,"w":315,"h":58,"font":"14px / 21.7px Lato, Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","margin":"0px","padding":"0px 0px 0px 12px","color":"rgb(92, 84, 103)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"H2","cls":"","text":"Is this you?\nYou might be in the right place if...","x":16,"y":8307.5,"w":343,"h":113.390625,"font":"700 36px / 37.8px \"IBM Plex Sans\", Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"700","letterSpacing":"-1.62px","margin":"0px 0px 35px","padding":"0px","color":"rgb(38, 38, 38)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"P","cls":"","text":"You're exhausted but can't slow down\nYou keep pushing through — but the energy just isn't there anymore.","x":16,"y":8455.890625,"w":343,"h":105,"font":"14px / 21.7px Lato, Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","margin":"0px","padding":"13px 15px","color":"rgb(92, 84, 103)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"P","cls":"","text":"You're facing a big change\nNew country, new role, new chapter — and you don't know where to start.","x":16,"y":8573.890625,"w":343,"h":123,"font":"14px / 21.7px Lato, Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","margin":"0px","padding":"13px 15px","color":"rgb(92, 84, 103)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"P","cls":"","text":"You feel stuck but don't know why\nYou've tried changing things — jobs, habits, routines. Nothing fully clicks.","x":16,"y":8709.890625,"w":343,"h":125,"font":"14px / 21.7px Lato, Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","margin":"0px","padding":"13px 15px","color":"rgb(92, 84, 103)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"P","cls":"","text":"You've been putting yourself last\nEveryone else comes first. You've lost track of what you actually want.","x":16,"y":8847.890625,"w":343,"h":99.796875,"font":"14px / 21.7px Lato, Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","margin":"0px","padding":"13px 15px","color":"rgb(92, 84, 103)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"P","cls":"","text":"You know you're capable of more\nBut something keeps getting in the way — and you're ready to find out what.","x":16,"y":8960.6875,"w":343,"h":99.796875,"font":"14px / 21.7px Lato, Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","margin":"0px","padding":"13px 15px","color":"rgb(92, 84, 103)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"P","cls":"","text":"You're doing everything right — still feel empty\nOn paper it looks good. Inside, something is missing.","x":16,"y":9073.484375,"w":343,"h":124.59375,"font":"14px / 21.7px Lato, Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","margin":"0px","padding":"13px 15px","color":"rgb(92, 84, 103)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"H2","cls":"site-section-title","text":"Reviews","x":16,"y":9311.078125,"w":343,"h":36.71875,"font":"700 36px / 36.72px \"IBM Plex Sans\", Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"700","letterSpacing":"-1.62px","margin":"0px 0px 39px","padding":"0px","color":"rgb(248, 241, 238)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"P","cls":"","text":"Working with Ksenia helped me understand the real reasons behind my procrast